= Web view

The WebView module opens local HTML, inline HTML text, web addresses and the examples gallery from Nelson.

== Functions

- #nlink(<webview:demo>)[demo]: Browse examples from loaded Nelson modules and external toolboxes.
- #nlink(<webview:nelson_htmlviewer_htmlviewer>)[nelson.htmlviewer.htmlviewer]: Handle to a Nelson HTML viewer window.
- #nlink(<webview:web>)[web]: Open a web page, local file, or HTML text.


